16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
It wasn't a sleeping bag,

17
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
It was a clear bag of Cheetos.

18
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,000
It was two feet wide and a foot and a half around, strapped where a sleeping bag goes,

19
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
And it was Cheetos.

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Did he give you any?

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
No, I just turned around, shook my head and walked back.

22
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
