255
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,000
And one of the familiar tools that we use,

256
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,000
train both adult and youth leaders in,

257
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,000
is the kind of stop, start,

258
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:47,000
