00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,000
when you're thinking about

270
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
the way that you're doing the work,

271
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,000
I think that's also a good tool to use.

272
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,000
